{'symbol': 'RE', 'date': '2022-05-12 13:00:00', 'title': 'EVEREST RE GROUP INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND TO $1.65', 'text': 'HAMILTON, BERMUDA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EVEREST RE GROUP, LTD. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED AN INCREASE IN THE REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND FROM $1.55 TO $1.65 PER COMMON SHARE. THIS DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON OR BEFORE JUNE 17, 2022 TO ALL SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 25, 2022. ABOUT EVEREST RE GROUP, LTD. EVEREST RE GROUP, LTD. (“EVEREST”) IS A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF REINSURANCE AND INSURANCE, OPERATING FOR CLOSE TO 50 YEARS THROUGH SUBSIDIARIES IN THE U.S., EUROPE, SINGA'}